sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant App as iPhone app
    participant Rd as Reader (on device)
    participant RP as Rust planner + engine (phone)
    participant API as Worker API
    participant H as Claude Haiku (opt-in)
    participant WF as Workflows
    participant SP as Painter container
    participant DB as D1 + R2

    Note over User,DB: Every day: daily painting (request-response)
    User->>App: Write entry, tap mood, Paint
    App->>App: Save entry locally first
    alt Foundation Models available
        App->>Rd: Entry text
        Rd-->>App: Reading
    else Opted in to cloud reading
        App->>API: Entry text (bounded timeout)
        API->>H: Entry text
        H-->>API: Reading
        API-->>App: Reading
    else Private fallback
        App->>App: Deterministic reader, Reading
    end
    alt Device passed feasibility gate
        App->>RP: plan + paint (Reading, seed)
        RP-->>App: Live timelapse, painting, stroke log
        App->>API: Sync painting, Reading, provenance
    else Not yet proven
        App->>API: Reading (fallback paint)
        API->>SP: Queue fallback paint
        SP->>DB: Painting + stroke log, status
        API-->>App: Ready, replay stroke log
    end
    API->>DB: Store status (source of truth)

    Note over User,DB: Each user's period close: chapter
    App->>User: Pending-sync / missing days shown (grace window)
    DB->>WF: Period closed, via outbox (key: user, chapter, period, inputVersion)
    WF->>DB: Gather synced Readings
    WF->>SP: Plan + paint chapter
    SP->>DB: Chapter painting + provenance
    WF-->>App: "Your month is ready"

    Note over User,DB: Signup anniversary: year
    DB->>WF: Anniversary reached, via outbox
    WF->>WF: Close chapter 12
    WF->>SP: Plan into a 12-slot layout, paint
    SP->>DB: Year painting (held, unreleased)
    WF->>WF: Optional constrained vision check (opt-in), at most 1 retry
    WF-->>App: Reveal begins (progress, then release)
    App->>API: Request reveal
    API->>API: Release authorization
    API-->>App: Signed URL, chapters gather, year painting appears
